12634378,2025-03-23,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"Subject : Formal Complaint and Request for Corrective Action Regarding Unlawful Reporting Practices To Whom It May Concern, I am writing to formally express my frustration and disappointment regarding the unlawful and negligent reporting practices conducted by your agency in relation to the alleged debts reported by XXXX and XXXX XXXX XXXX. Despite my numerous disputes over the years, you have consistently failed to conduct a thorough and reasonable investigation, which has resulted in significant harm to my creditworthiness and financial standing. 

